## 11. Compliance — CISA 2026 Minimum Elements for a Software Bill of Materials

Informational; not part of the weighted scorecard. `warn` = covered only by a declared unknown (NOASSERTION); `unverified` = cannot be judged from the document alone. Gate on these in CI with `--require-min-elements` (skip IDs via `--skip-min-elements`).

| Element | ID | Scope | mikebom v0.1.0-alpha.47 | syft v1.42.3 |
|---------|----|-------|-----------------------|------------|
| SBOM Author | `author` | document | ✅ mikebom contributors | ✅ Anchore, Inc |
| Author Signature | `signature` | document | ❔ not signed in-document | ❔ not signed in-document |
| Data Format Name | `format-name` | document | ✅ SPDX | ✅ SPDX |
| Data Format Version | `format-version` | document | ✅ SPDX-2.3 | ✅ SPDX-2.3 |
| Generation Context | `generation-context` | document | ❌ not declared (inferred: source) | ❌ not declared (inferred: binary) |
| Timestamp | `timestamp` | document | ✅ 2026-06-16T16:02:16Z | ✅ 2026-06-16T16:05:00Z |
| Tool Name | `tool-name` | document | ✅ mikebom-0.1.0-alpha.47 | ✅ syft-1.42.3 |
| Tool Version | `tool-version` | document | ✅ mikebom-0.1.0-alpha.47 | ✅ syft-1.42.3 |
| SBOM Version | `sbom-version` | document | ✅ https://example.com/demo/source | ✅ https://example.com/demo/binary |
| Component Producer | `producer` | component | ✅ 4/4 (100.0%) | ⚠️ 0/3 (0.0%), 3 unknown |
| Component Name | `name` | component | ✅ 4/4 (100.0%) | ✅ 3/3 (100.0%) |
| Component Version | `version` | component | ✅ 4/4 (100.0%) | ✅ 3/3 (100.0%) |
| Software Identifiers | `identifiers` | component | ✅ 4/4 (100.0%) | ✅ 3/3 (100.0%) |
| Component Hash (value + algorithm) | `hash` | component | ❌ 3/4 (75.0%) | ❌ 1/3 (33.3%) |
| License | `license` | component | ✅ 4/4 (100.0%) | ⚠️ 2/3 (66.7%), 1 unknown |
